@--[end]. The reason these things are said of the sons of Israel, is that by "Israel" is signified the Divine Celestial Spiritual.

@4402. "And called it El Elohe Israel" (Genesis 33:20) = interior worship from the Divine Spiritual. "Israel" = the Spiritual.

@--[4]. "Israel" = the Lord as to the Divine Spiritual; and, in the representative sense, the Lord's Spiritual Church; or, what is the same, the man who is such.

